{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"article-content\" id=\"artibody\">\n<p></p><p>特朗普稱，美國政府沒有理由認為黃仁勳回歸英偉達會帶來任何國家安全風險。美國司法部長已經證實，美國政府並未掌握證據證明他存在任何不法行為。</p><p>特朗普表示，就我個人而言，我對黃仁勳有所了解，他是一名國寶級人才。與此同時，英偉達應當繼續確保其履行法律義務以及守護美國國家安全這份愛國責任。祝賀黃仁勳、英偉達董事會、美國民眾 —— 乃至全世界！</p> </div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T15:16:14.400174+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":167,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T14:28:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T11:17:14.749424+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T15:09:38.696228+00:00","content_hash":"eaf6249995ed24823ee79d29de3e1b21650004715e3c13588c03e9fd4f32f77e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T15:16:14.400174+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}